@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
participant "Customer App" as P0
participant "Booking API / Service" as P1
participant "Location Service" as P2
participant "Pricing Service" as P3
participant "BookingRepository" as P4
participant "Redis" as P5
participant "User-Driver Service" as P6
participant "Driver App" as P7
== 1. Create booking and invite a driver ==
P0 -> P1 : POST /api/v1/bookings
P1 -> P1 : Check request rate and active booking
P1 -> P2 : Find nearby drivers (configured radius)
P2 --> P1 : Nearby drivers
P1 -> P3 : Calculate fare (route + nearby supply)
P3 --> P1 : Price and distance
P1 -> P4 : Save Booking: PENDING
P1 -> P6 : Check candidate is ONLINE
P6 --> P1 : Online status
P1 -> P5 : Reserve driver: SET NX, TTL = 30 s
P5 --> P1 : Reservation acquired
P1 -> P7 : WebSocket: /queue/driver/match
P1 -> P1 : Start asynchronous 20 s timeout
P1 --> P0 : 200 OK: BookingResponse (PENDING)
== 2. Driver accepts the invitation ==
P7 -> P1 : PUT /api/v1/bookings/{bookingId}/accept
P1 -> P5 : Read driver reservation
P5 --> P1 : Reserved bookingId
P1 -> P4 : Load booking and check PENDING
alt Reservation matches and booking is PENDING
P1 -> P4 : Save ACCEPTED, driverId, acceptedAt
P1 -> P5 : Delete driver reservation
P1 -> P6 : Update driver status: BUSY
P1 -> P0 : WebSocket: /queue/booking/status (ACCEPTED)
P1 --> P7 : 200 OK: BookingResponse
else Reservation invalid or booking is not PENDING
P1 --> P7 : 400 Bad Request
end
== Timeout: still PENDING after 20 s → release driver and try another ==
P1 -> P1 : BookingTimeoutService → BookingReassignService
@enduml
